      "text": "so, based on the history and the examination, this looks most like a superficial partial-thickness burn. I'm prescribing paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours if needed, for three days. That should help with burn pain. Cool the area under running water for twenty minutes and cover it with a non-stick dressing, and leave the blister alone. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
